            "icon": "clock",
            "source": "how_to_use",
            "text": "<ol><li><strong>Take a pea-sized amount.</strong> Scoop a small portion of resin with a clean, dry spoon.</li><li><strong>Dissolve it.</strong> Stir it into warm water, milk or tea until it has dissolved.</li><li><strong>Drink once a day.</strong> Start small and keep to the amount on the label.</li></ol>",
